::Q001::[markdown]aorist (1) active optative 3rd pl. of the verb “I loosen”:{
	~%-100%λύετε#Incorrect. **λύετε** is the present active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I loosen” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%ἐπέμπετε#Incorrect. **ἐπέμπετε** is the imperfect active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I send” (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%-#Incorrect. **-** is the aorist (1) active optative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 3).
	~%50%λύσαιεν#Correct: **λύσαιεν** is the correct form for aorist (1) active optative 3rd pl. of the verb “I loosen” (Chapter 3).
	~%50%λύσειαν#Correct: **λύσειαν** is the correct form for aorist (1) active optative 3rd pl. of the verb “I loosen” (Chapter 3).
}


