	~%100%πέμψετε#Correct: **πέμψετε** is the correct form for future active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I send” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἐπεπόμφης#Incorrect. **ἐπεπόμφης** is the pluperfect active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I send” (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%λύσω#Incorrect. **λύσω** is the future active indicative 1st sing. of the verb “I loosen” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%κελεῦσαι#Incorrect. **κελεῦσαι** is the aorist (1) active infinitive of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%ἐκεκελεύκαμεν#Incorrect. **ἐκεκελεύκαμεν** is the pluperfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 3).
}


